  "result": "Fixed. Clamped `IntRange` with an open bound returned a value outside the range because `IntRange._clamp` in `src/click/types.py` moved the wrong way: `bound - dir` instead of `bound + dir`.\n\nFor example, `IntRange(0, min_open=True, clamp=True)` given `-5` returned `-1` instead of `1`, and `IntRange(max=5, max_open=True, clamp=True)` given `9` returned `6` instead of `4`.\n\nI added two regression cases for these to `tests/test_types.py`, and that file now passes (43 passed, 2 skipped). I did not run the full suite or update `CHANGES.md`.",
